    "author_association": "NONE",
    "body": "### Contributing guidelines\n\n- [X] I have read [CONTRIBUTING.md](https://github.com/echasnovski/mini.nvim/blob/main/CONTRIBUTING.md)\n- [X] I have read [CODE_OF_CONDUCT.md](https://github.com/echasnovski/mini.nvim/blob/main/CODE_OF_CONDUCT.md)\n\n### Module(s)\n\nmini.hues\n\n### Description\n\nI find the current saturation values of medium and high are often outside of the chroma range I would like. Are you open to exposing a config option for it that's mutually exclusive with the saturation one? An alternative could be to introduce a fourth value in between medium and high, but of course that's not as flexible.",
