        {
            "author_association": "MEMBER",
            "body": "There are now `'lowmedium'` and `'mediumhigh'` saturation levels. They are essentially exactly in the middle of 'low'-'medium' and 'medium'-'high' ranges. The eventual grades are not uniform (chromas 4-6-8-12-16 instead of a uniform 3-6-9-12-15), but making it uniform has small gains while still technically being breaking change (which are bad).\r\n\r\nThanks again for the (alternative) suggestion! This will benefit some of the future planned work.",
